    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Pharisees came up to him and tested him by asking, “Is it lawful to divorce one's wife for any cause?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, “Have you not read that he who made them from the beginning made them male and female, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 1.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.5.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eph 5.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 6.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and said, ‘For this reason a man shall leave his father and mother and be joined to his wife, and the two shall become one flesh’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they are no longer two but one flesh. What therefore God has joined together, let not man put asunder.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.24.1+DEU.24.2+DEU.24.3+DEU.24.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 24.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " They said to him, “Why then did Moses command one to give a certificate of divorce, and to put her away?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to them, “For your hardness of heart Moses allowed you to divorce your wives, but from the beginning it was not so. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 5.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 16.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.7.10+1CO.7.11+1CO.7.12+1CO.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 7.10-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And I say to you: whoever divorces his wife, except for unchastity,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities, after",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "unchastity,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "makes her commit adultery",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and marries another, commits adultery.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities insert",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and he who marries a divorced woman commits adultery",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
