            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then children were brought to him that he might lay his hands on them and pray. The disciples rebuked the people; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
